# Used instead of the root .dockerignore when building docs-site/Dockerfile
# (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). The site links to files across the
# repository, so only build output, VCS data and secrets are left out.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
docs-site/content
docs-site/public
docs-site/.source
bin
dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
# Live work files a checkout of this repository can hold: never in the image.
.provision
.saphan
.saphan-*
_*
**/_EXEC_*
**/_REVIEW_*
SHOUT_*
